# Line endings.
#
# Twenty-eight files in this repository were committed with CRLF endings
# while the other 579 text files used LF. Nothing depended on the
# difference, but it was invisible until something wrote to one of those
# files: an editor or script that rewrites a file whole would turn a two
# line change into a diff touching every line. Normalizing removed the
# inconsistency, and this file keeps it from coming back.
#
# text=auto lets git detect binary files rather than trusting the list
# below, which is a backstop for the formats this repository actually
# carries. The checked in Windows DLLs in storm_analysis/c_libraries are
# the ones that matter most - rewriting those would break the wheel that
# the Windows CI job builds.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary. Never touch these.
*.amat binary
*.bin  binary
*.dax  binary
*.dll  binary
*.gif  binary
*.hdf5 binary
*.jar  binary
*.mat  binary
*.npy  binary
*.png  binary
*.spline binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
